# This repository holds published release assets, and every one of them is uploaded to a GitHub
# release by the workflow rather than committed. Nothing large should ever be in the working tree,
# so these patterns exist to catch a hand-built installer somebody dragged in to test an upload.
*.exe
*.dmg
*.zip
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.rpm
*.blockmap
*.msi

# The update feed. It belongs in a release's assets, not in git — a copy committed here would be
# read by nobody and would go stale the moment the next version ships.
latest.yml
latest-mac.yml
latest-linux.yml

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
